        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Huddersfield Giants R.L.F.C., Huddersfield Town F.C.\n- Places: Huddersfield, West Yorkshire, England\n- Competitions: Super League\n- Venues: Kirklees Stadium\n- Topics: rugby league\n\nFacts:\n- Huddersfield is in West Yorkshire, England, and is described as the birthplace of rugby league.\n- Huddersfield Giants R.L.F.C. are an English professional rugby league club from Huddersfield, West Yorkshire.\n- Huddersfield Giants R.L.F.C. play in the Super League competition.\n- Huddersfield Giants R.L.F.C. play their home games at Kirklees Stadium.\n- Kirklees Stadium is a multi-use sports stadium in Huddersfield, West Yorkshire, England.\n- Kirklees Stadium is shared by Huddersfield Giants R.L.F.C. and Huddersfield Town F.C.",
